# OboxSTEAM Mobile — Parent API Map

Load when wiring `src/lib/api/*`, screens, or deep links. Full Swagger tooling: `api-spec.mdc`.

**Refresh local OpenAPI:** `pnpm sync:api-spec` (same URL as FE). Then use **obox-api** MCP or `specs/oboxsteam.openapi.json`. When FE already has the Zod wrappers, re-copy per `SYNC.md`.

Base URL: `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` (same backend as FE). Paths are `/api/...`. Auth: Bearer via SecureStore session (except `skipAuth` flows).

---

## Auth / account

| Method | Path | FE helper | Mobile use |
|--------|------|-----------|------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | `login` | Email/password login |
| POST | `/api/auth/refresh-token` | `refreshToken` / interceptor | Silent refresh on 401 |
| GET | `/api/account/me` | `getCurrentUser` | Role gate (Parent only), profile |
| PUT | `/api/account/me` | `updateProfile` | Profile edit (phase 1b) |

---

## Parent (`/api/parent`)

| Method | Path | FE helper | Mobile use |
|--------|------|-----------|------------|
| GET | `/api/parent/links` | `getParentLinks` | Children list (home) |
| POST | `/api/parent/request-link` | `requestParentLink` | Request link by parent email |
| POST | `/api/parent/magic-login` | `parentMagicLogin` | Deep link (`skipAuth`) |
| POST | `/api/parent/complete-profile` | `completeParentProfile` | Blocking profile completion |
