## Payments (parent)

| Method | Path | FE helper | Mobile use |
|--------|------|-----------|------------|
| POST | `/api/payments/parent-checkout` | `parentCheckout` | Email-link checkout (`skipAuth`) → open `checkoutUrl` |
| GET | `/api/payments/{id}` | `getPaymentById` | Receipt / status |
| PATCH | `/api/payments/{id}/cancel` | `cancelPayment` | Cancel pending if exposed |
| POST | `/api/payments/request-parent` | `requestParentPayment` | Skip v1 UI unless needed |

---

## Notifications

| Method | Path | FE helper | Mobile use |
|--------|------|-----------|------------|
| GET | `/api/notifications` | `getNotifications` | Inbox |
| GET | `/api/notifications/unread-count` | `getUnreadNotificationCount` | Badge |
| PATCH | `/api/notifications/{id}/read` | `markNotificationRead` | Mark read |
| PATCH | `/api/notifications/read-all` | `markAllNotificationsRead` | Mark all |
| Hub | `/hubs/notifications` | `createNotificationHubConnection` | Phase 1b SignalR |

Parent-relevant notification types → mobile routes (not web hrefs): `ParentPaymentRequested`, `ParentModuleRetakeRequested`, `ParentLink*`, payment/program progress → children / browser checkout.

---

## Envelope

Same as FE: `{ isSuccess, value, error }` with `value` often `{ code, message, data? }`. Parse via `src/lib/api/schemas.ts` helpers — never treat raw Swagger DTOs as the top-level response.
